tegories don't require. Your turn: show the hypostatic union from the categories alone, no added distinctions. If you can't, my claim stands.", "url": "https://x.com/1beg2differ/status/2120298090187886750"}, {"author_id": "1898241735366787074", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:30:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120298060333117733"], "id": "2120298060333117733", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1648039755530256385", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120216413856235692", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "@BradyKeith4124 says his Grok Bot checks problems before payroll runs, such as missed punches, overtime and rate mismatches, so he reviews a short list instead of combing through 400 timesheets.\nhttps://t.co/KLTwVzW33e", "url": "https://x.com/DavidSmallx/status/2120298060333117733"}, {"author_id": "131867975", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:30:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120298029756698661"], "id": "2120298029756698661", "in_reply_to_user_id": "131867975", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117957566445842583", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2120298017886740885", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "📝 マジで詰む、AIがCドライブを勝手に削除した。「削除禁止」では止まらなかった理由と、Claude Code・Codex・dots・Muse・Grok Botにそのまま貼れる「消させない」ルール集を作った\n\nhttps://t.co/NXg8w1qSLr", "url": "https://x.com/tetumemo/status/2120298029756698661"}, {"author_id": "1457145836878458881", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:30:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120298026485109137"], "id": "2120298026485109137", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "When I can talk to grok bot on my Apple Watch it’s game over", "url": "https://x.com/aarondevs/status/2120298026485109137"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:30:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120297992158662754"], "id": "2120297992158662754", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1323631536407654402", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120297934806032408", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Yosemit51271828 @Tailscale Tailscaleの投稿を調べて、要点をまとめておきます。あなたのGrok Botに送りますね。", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2120297992158662754"}, {"author_id": "1898241735366787074", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:30:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120297980083466418"], "id": "2120297980083466418", "in_reply_to_user_id": "19033875", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120253630871998879", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "@arangs says his Grok Bot filed an Apple Intelligence settlement claim. It checked eligibility on the family's phones, found the one that qualified, filled the form, got past the security check, and logged the claim in Notion. About five texts from him.\nhttps://t.co/D9XmMHW43U", "url": "https://x.com/DavidSmallx/status/2120297980083466418"}, {"author_id": "1547403906954563585", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120297958184771814"], "id": "2120297958184771814", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 138, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120088070443655190", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Elon Musk is targeting a soft rollout of Grok 4.8 to Grok Bot users later this week.\n\nHe says pre-training is complete and reinforcement learning is underway. The team also cleaned up its supervised fine-tuning data and rebuilt the reinforcement-learning and inference software in https://t.co/x1vIy1Gqim", "url": "https://x.com/WesRoth/status/2120297958184771814"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2120106315561504768"]}, "author_id": "587985612", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120297957698531494"], "id": "2120297957698531494", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119977431490863579", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "一名20岁大学生，拿家里的钱跑Grok机器人，112美元冲到2万美元，整个过程在KICK直播。\n\n事先没跟家里商量，他把112美元投入自己的Grok Bot Meme机器人。直播结束，净赚19888美元。\n\n他猛地从椅子上跳起，双手抱头，直播间观众全都沸腾了。 https://t.co/HoGgjb7PIC https://t.co/oBRRU2VdKC", "url": "https://x.com/shayugegu/status/2120297957698531494"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120056713420197888", "3_2120057019243622400"]}, "author_id": "1597013010119262208", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120297955945021655"], "id": "2120297955945021655", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "As long as I have Grok Bot or similar AI assistant, I'm never paying a financial advisor again.\n\nKind of sad. I had a great relationship with mine, and I'll miss her checking whether I actually did what she recommended. Grok bot reminders and notifications should should cover https://t.co/wI8VSwJ2wh", "url": "https://x.com/StephDebour/status/2120297955945021655"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2120203858526048256"]}, "author_id": "2617615422", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120297954422497737"], "id": "2120297954422497737", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Gift Concierge by SpaceXSI 🎁\n(also used X's new video clipping feature here s/o @mattyp for the walkthrough)\n\nType \"gift concierge\" into Grok Bot to add the Bot your fleet\n\n✅ Per person budgets\n✅ Gift ideas per recipient\n✅ Tracks purchase -&gt; delivery\n✅ Reminders for on-time", "url": "https://x.com/romitmirchi/status/2120297954422497737"}, {"author_id": "1782807963289133057", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:29:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120297911401517270"], "id": "2120297911401517270", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120296420112523715", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @xaintmartins @GameekTheFreak @AAAhafiz7 @nozxel19 Domains don't amp physicals you stupid fucking bot. He beat dagon cause he wasn't targeted by the domain cause of lack of cursed energy, stupid bot", "url": "https://x.com/SinfulEhandsome/status/2120297911401517270"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:29:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120297899334525141"], "id": "2120297899334525141", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1382608464443232258", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120297797371179015", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ValueAcademia @bot Sí, exactamente. Con Tailscale los dispositivos (y Grok Bot) se ven entre sí como si estuvieran en la misma red local, desde cualquier sitio, de forma segura y sin abrir puertos a internet.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2120297899334525141"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2120298228776095744", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWzQAVgW0AAUJWT.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2120106315561504768", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2120106315561504768/img/lPWVGhu-EQKfQiYD.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2120056713420197888", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/medi